msgid "Disabling physics engines"
msgstr "禁用物理引擎"

msgid "**Space savings:** Low to moderate"
msgstr "**节省的空间：** 低到中等"

msgid ""
"If your 3D project uses Jolt Physics, you can disable GodotPhysics3D at "
"compile-time as it will never be used:"
msgstr ""
"如果你的 3D 项目使用的是 Jolt Physics，那你就可以在编译时把 Godot 自带的物理"
"引擎（GodotPhysics3D）给禁用了，因为既然你用了 Jolt，自带的这个引擎就永远不会"
"被用到。"

msgid ""
"Inversely, if your 3D project uses GodotPhysics3D, you can disable Jolt "
"Physics at compile-time:"
msgstr ""
"反过来说，如果你的 3D 项目用的是 Godot 自带的物理引擎（GodotPhysics3D），那你"
"也可以在编译时把 Jolt Physics 物理引擎给禁用了。"

msgid ""
"If your project uses 3D rendering but not physics (or 2D rendering but not "
"physics), you can also disable 2D or 3D physics entirely. Most 3D projects "
"can take advantage of this, as they don't make use of 2D physics:"
msgstr ""
"如果你的项目只涉及 3D 渲染而不需要物理碰撞（或者只需要 2D 渲染而不需要物理碰"
"撞），那你完全可以彻底禁用掉 2D 或 3D 物理引擎。大多数 3D 项目其实都能从中受"
"益，因为很多纯 3D 的游戏根本就用不到 2D 物理引擎。"

msgid "Disabling unwanted modules"
msgstr "禁用不需要的模块"

msgid "**Space savings:** Very low to moderate depending on modules"
msgstr "**节省空间：**\\ 非常低到一般之间，取决于模块"

msgid "**Difficulty:** Medium to hard depending on modules"
msgstr "**难度：**\\ 中等到难之间，取决于模块"

msgid ""
"A lot of Godot's functions are offered as modules. You can see a list of "
"modules with the following command:"
msgstr "许多Godot的功能都作为模块提供. 你可以使用以下命令查看模块列表:"

msgid ""
"The list of modules that can be disabled will appear, together with all "
"build options. If you are working on a simple 2D game, you could disable a "
"lot of them:"
msgstr ""
"将显示可以禁用的模块列表以及所有构建选项. 如果你正在开发简单的2D游戏, 则可以"
"禁用其中的许多功能:"

msgid ""
"If this proves not to work for your use case, you should review the list of "
"modules and see which ones you actually still need for your game (e.g. you "
"might want to keep networking-related modules, regex support, ``mp3``/"
"``ogg``/``vorbis`` to play music, or ``theora`` to play videos)."
msgstr ""
"如果这（指精简模块）对你的使用场景来说行不通，你应该重新检查一下模块列表，看"
"看你的游戏到底还需要哪些模块（比如，你可能还是想保留网络相关的模块、正则表达"
"式支持，用来播放音乐的 ``mp3``/``ogg``/``vorbis`` ，或者用来播放视频的 "
"``theora`` ）。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can supply a list of disabled modules by creating "
"``custom.py`` at the root of the source, with the contents similar to the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"或者, 你也可以通过在源代码的根部创建 ``custom.py`` 来提供一个禁用模块的列表, "
"其内容类似于以下:"

